# A script for examples/hello, which knows nothing of it: run from the build
# folder (see "Driving any application headlessly" in README.md)
#
#   RAVEN_HEADLESS=1 RAVEN_SCRIPT=../examples/headless/hello.script bin/raven_hello
#
# hello names none of its widgets: they are found by what they read.

expect "text:Press the button" shown
snap hello-start
click "text:Click me"
expect "text:Clicked 1 time" shown
click "text:Click me"
expect "text:Clicked 2 times" shown
mark clicked-twice
snap hello-clicked
tree hello-tree.json
